# Gangelia copyright for new files

When creating **new** source files on this fork (`dspip/lerobot` / Gangelia work):

```python
# Copyright 2026 Gangelia. All rights reserved.
#
# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
# ...
```

- Do **not** use `The HuggingFace Inc. team` on newly authored files.
- Do **not** rewrite copyright headers on existing upstream HuggingFace files you only edit.
- Apply the same header style (year + `Gangelia`) to new tests and examples as well.
